  "notes": [
    "No release before 0.5.0 may claim any of this is balanced: every magnitude in the shipped content carries tuningStatus untuned and the balance harness owns all of them -- so this file is a measurement and not a balance claim.",
    "The universe is still degenerate in the following ways, and this sweep closes none of them. Nothing in packages/scenario opens a portal, so no raid runs and no summon is ever created; portal-rush is therefore measured on what it does instead of raiding. Scribing stops when the materials stock empties.",
    "Wired into npm run verify and into both enumerated GitHub Actions jobs, and reached by the self-hosted runner through verify. It is the cheapest gate in the suite that can see a god verb at all."
  ],
